{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T18:29:48.739Z","entries":{"docs-7.25\u0000## ip/ipsec/key **Type:** Directory":"## ip/ipsec/key \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/ipsec/key/rsa **Type:** Directory":"## ip/ipsec/key/rsa \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/ipsec/mode-config **Type:** Directory":"## ip/ipsec/mode-config \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/ipsec/peer **Type:** Directory":"## ip/ipsec/peer \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/ipsec/policy **Type:** Directory":"## ip/ipsec/policy \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/ipsec/policy/group **Type:** Directory":"## ip/ipsec/policy/group \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/ipsec/profile **Type:** Directory":"## ip/ipsec/profile \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/ipsec/proposal **Type:** Directory":"## ip/ipsec/proposal \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/ipsec/settings **Type:** Settings Directory":"## ip/ipsec/settings \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ip/ipsec/statistics **Type:** Settings Directory":"## ip/ipsec/statistics \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.25\u0000:::info Policy order is important. It works similarly to firewall filters where policies are executed from top to bottom(priority parameter is removed). All packets are IPIP encapsulated in tunnel mode, and their new IP header's src-address and dst-address are set to sa-src-address and sa-dst-address values of this policy. If you do not use tunnel mode(i.e., you use transport mode), then only packets whose source and destination addresses are the same as sa-src-address and sa-dst-address can be processed by this policy. Transport mode can only work with packets that originate at and are destined for IPsec peers(hosts that established security associations). To encrypt traffic between networks(or a network and a host) you have to use tunnel mode. :::":":::info\n策略顺序很重要。其工作方式类似于防火墙过滤器，策略从上到下执行（priority 参数已移除）。\n\n在 tunnel 模式下，所有数据包都会被 IPIP 封装，其新 IP 头的 src-address 和 dst-address 会设置为该策略的 sa-src-address 和 sa-dst-address 值。如果不使用 tunnel 模式（即使用 transport 模式），则只有源地址和目的地址与 sa-src-address 和 sa-dst-address 相同的数据包才能由该策略处理。transport 模式只能处理源自 IPsec 对等体且发往 IPsec 对等体（建立安全关联的主机）的数据包。要加密网络之间（或网络与主机之间）的流量，必须使用 tunnel 模式。\n:::","docs-7.25\u0000Generate a private key. Takes two parameters, name of the newly generated key and key size 1024,2048 and 4096.":"生成私钥。接受两个参数：新生成密钥的名称，以及密钥大小 1024、2048 和 4096。","docs-7.25\u0000ISAKMP and IKEv2 configuration attributes are configured in this menu.":"ISAKMP 和 IKEv2 配置属性在此菜单中配置。","docs-7.25\u0000Import key from file.":"从文件导入密钥。","docs-7.25\u0000Proposal information that will be sent by IKE daemons to establish SAs for certain policies.":"IKE 守护进程发送的、用于为特定策略建立 SA 的提案信息。","docs-7.25\u0000This menu allows you to create additional policy groups used by policy templates.":"此菜单用于创建供策略模板使用的其他策略组。","docs-7.25\u0000This menu lists all imported public and private keys that can be used for peer authentication. The menu has several commands to work with keys.":"此菜单列出所有可用于对等体身份验证的已导入公钥和私钥。该菜单包含多个用于处理密钥的命令。","docs-7.25\u0000This menu shows various IPsec statistics and errors.":"此菜单显示各种 IPsec 统计信息和错误。"}}
